    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h1 id=\"TreatmentDetailsControl-Purpose\">Purpose</h1><p>Treatment/Drug Details Control can be configured to display all the the prescription or drug order details (for configured number of visits).</p><h1 id=\"TreatmentDetailsControl-Screenshot\">Screenshot</h1><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114746475/Medication%20Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487319762729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=668&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/114746475/Medication%20Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487319762729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114746445\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Medication Tab.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"114746475\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"2\" data-media-id=\"e6c9bbef-c1cd-4443-8989-c8026e9b874d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114746475/Medication%20Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487319762729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1248&amp;height=467 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/114746475/Medication%20Tab.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1487319762729&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=668&amp;height=250 1x\"></span><br/></span></p><h1 id=\"TreatmentDetailsControl-Configuration\">Configuration</h1><div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"4b3fd494-9d80-477b-9c8c-947cb5e94712\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">Where to Configure ?</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>Add to <em>clinical/dashboard.json</em> for it to appear on the <em>patient dashboard</em> or Add to <em>clinical/visit.json</em> for it to appear on the<em> visit dashboard</em>.</p></div></div><h3 id=\"TreatmentDetailsControl-SampleConfig\">Sample Config</h3><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"d661a338-f15b-4b87-9e8b-1d139f905170\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>Add to dashboard.json (under sections) for it to appear on the patient dashboard</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">&quot;sections&quot;:{ \n  &quot;treatmentsDetails&quot;: {\n    &quot;title&quot;:&quot;Treatments Details&quot;,\n    &quot;translationKey&quot; : &quot;treatmentsDetails&quot;,\n    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;drugOrderDetails&quot;,\n    &quot;displayOrder&quot;: 1,\n    &quot;displayType&quot;:&quot;Full-Page&quot;,\n    &quot;dashboardParams&quot;: {\n            &quot;drugNames&quot;:[&quot;Isoniazid&quot;,&quot;Paracetamol 500mg&quot;, &quot;Sodium Thiosulphate Camical 500gm&quot;, &quot;Isosorbide Mononitrate&quot;],\n            &quot;showDetailsButton&quot;:true\n     }\n   }\n }</pre>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e21e6bc-65b4-4f30-a341-0dc091c2e859\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"c600f8c4-b8b4-4eb8-bd41-e903ed368a03\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div><p> </p></div></div><div class=\"panel conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"11c594ed-5883-4869-a352-0f4f6562d86e\" data-macro-name=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelHeader\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;background-color: #1FA5A0;color: White;\"><b>Related Display Controls</b></div><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p> </p><ul class=\"childpages-macro conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-macro-id=\"de12be85-d772-4bad-93f7-a404f07e5146\" data-macro-name=\"children\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114207300/Chronic+Treatment+Chart+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114207300\" data-linked-resource-version=\"12\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Chronic Treatment Chart Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/98402409/Drug+Order+Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"98402409\" data-linked-resource-version=\"13\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Drug Order / Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/99123216/Treatment+Display+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"99123216\" data-linked-resource-version=\"20\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Display Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/114746475/Treatment+Details+Control\" data-linked-resource-id=\"114746475\" data-linked-resource-version=\"2\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Treatment Details Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/3152838666/Sending+prescription+to+patients\" data-linked-resource-id=\"3152838666\" data-linked-resource-version=\"8\" data-linked-resource-type=\"page\">Sending prescription to patients</a></li></ul><p> </p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
